<para id="RM0000026XZ007X" category="C" type-id="8021M" name-id="066NZ-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0443/94</dtccode>
<dtcname>EVAP Purge Control D-VSV Open Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000026XZ007X_05" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8E00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>To prevent emissions, fuel vapor generated in the fuel tank is sent through the charcoal canister to the intake manifold and burned in the cylinders. The canister purge volume changes according to the driving conditions as the engine control computer controls the opening and closing of the VSV.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
